{"id":"wb-8-514","name":"大麦地岩画","title":"大麦地岩画","status":"catalogue","text":"大麦地岩画位于宁夏回族自治区中卫市沙坡头区，是全国重点文物保护单位。名录记载的时代为新石器时代至西夏，文物类型为石窟寺及石刻，本条按第八批名录收录。","sourceUrl":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/content/2019-10/16/content_5440577.htm","sourceName":"公布名录","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e2ef33a862903bc75e2f0199.jpg","title":"宁夏中卫大麦地岩画.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%AE%81%E5%A4%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%8D%AB%E5%A4%A7%E9%BA%A6%E5%9C%B0%E5%B2%A9%E7%94%BB.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8c/%E5%AE%81%E5%A4%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%8D%AB%E5%A4%A7%E9%BA%A6%E5%9C%B0%E5%B2%A9%E7%94%BB.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"GHOSTGHOSTH2O","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​宁夏中卫的大麦地岩画的羊群和狩猎场景","width":320,"height":227,"matchEvidence":"维基共享资源名称与所在地一致"}}